    Bug 2042055 - Sort the list of calendars before choosing one for item creation. r=mkmelin
    We pick the first usable calendar if the selected calendar is unusable. But the list of usable
    calendars should be sorted before picking the first one.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D302262

